↓</span></a>\n        <div class="copy-stack" id="copy-stack">\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-opening" data-copy="0">\n            <p class="eyebrow">A JOURNEY THROUGH SOLAR ENERGY</p>\n            <h1 id="chapter-title">ENERGY<br>BEGINS HERE.</h1>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-sun" data-copy="1" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">THE SOURCE</p>\n            <h2>OUR NEAREST<br>STAR.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">A living surface. Light in every direction.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-flight" data-copy="2" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">FROM THE SUN</p>\n            <h2>FOLLOW<br>THE LIGHT.</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-earth" data-copy="3" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">TO THE PLACES WE WORK</p>\n            <h2>SUNLIGHT<br>REACHES US.</h2>\n\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-britain" data-copy="4" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">GREAT BRITAIN</p><h2>CLOSER<br>TO HOME.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">G99 application support<br>across Great Britain.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-building" data-copy="5" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">AN ILLUSTRATIVE COMMERCIAL SITE</p><h2>A WORKING<br>ROOF.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">The installation details<br>shape the application.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-panel" data-copy="6" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">AT THE SURFACE</p><h2>LIGHT MEETS<br>SILICON.</h2>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-glass" data-copy="7" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">THE SAME CELL, ENLARGED</p><h2>BENEATH<br>THE GLASS.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">Through protective glass<br>to the silicon cell.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-cell" data-copy="8" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">ABSORPTION AND COLLECTION</p><h2>LIGHT BECOMES<br>POWER.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">The silicon absorbs light and transfers its energy to charge carriers.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-dc" data-copy="9" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">COLLECTED AT THE CONTACTS</p><h2>DIRECT<br>CURRENT.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">The array and inverter details<br>shape the application.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-inverter" data-copy="10" aria-hidden="true">\n            <p class="eyebrow">AT THE INVERTER</p><h2>DC BECOMES<br>AC.</h2>\n            <p class="chapter-description">The inverter converts the array’s direct current into alternating current.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-operation-note" data-copy="11" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">OPERATION, ILLUSTRATED</p><p class="operation-context">Illustration of operation after the required permissions and commissioning.</p></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-business" data-copy="12" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">A WORKING BUSINESS</p><h2>ENERGY,<br>PUT TO WORK.</h2><p class="chapter-description">From rooftop generation to the places your business needs power.</p><p class="still-operation-context">Illustration of operation after the required permissions and commissioning.</p></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-storage" data-copy="13" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">OPTIONAL STORAGE · CHARGING</p><h2>KEEP SOME<br>FOR LATER.</h2><p class="chapter-description">Optional storage can shift when stored energy is used.</p></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-later" data-copy="14" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">LATER · STORED ENERGY</p><h2>WHEN IT’S<br>NEEDED.</h2><p class="chapter-description">Stored energy can help supply the business.</p></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-grid" data-copy="15" aria-hidden="true"><p class="eyebrow">WHEN THE GRID SUPPLIES POWER.</p><h2>PART OF A<br>CONNECTED<br>SYSTEM.</h2><p class="chapter-description">Generation, storage and the grid work within the agreed connection.</p></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-long" data-copy="16" aria-hidden="true"><h2>A LONG<br>JOURNEY.</h2></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-connection" data-copy="17" aria-hidden="true"><h2>A CONNECTION<br>WORTH GETTING<br>RIGHT.</h2></div>\n          <div class="chapter-copy copy-payoff" data-copy="18" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="payoff-mark" viewBox="0 0 34 34" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 2.5 4 26.5h7.4L17 16.2l5.6 10.3H30L17 2.5Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M18.2 9.5 12 21h4.3l-1 6.5L21.6 16h-4.4l1-6.5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg><h2>AESIR<span>SOLAR</span></h2><p class="chapter-description">Your G99 application.<br>Prepared. Submitted. Followed through.</p><a class="payoff-action" href="/apply.html">Start your application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class="journey-note">A cinematic scientific illustration.<br>Distances and time are compressed.</p>\n        <p class="process-note" id="process-note">Illustrative layers and motion, enlarged.<br>Continuing light and a connected circuit.</p>\n        <div id="inverter-annotations" hidden><span data-inverter-label="dcLabel">DC input</span><span data-inverter-label="acLabel">AC output</span><span data-inverter-label="timeLabel">Voltage ↕ · Time →</span></div>\n        <div id="storage-annotations" hidden><span data-storage-label="batteryLabel">Optional battery</span><span data-storage-label="converterLabel">Storage converter</span></div>\n        <div class="chapter-footer">\n          <div class="scroll-cue"><span class="scroll-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="scroll-label">SCROLL TO FOLLOW 